      "body": "## Motivation\n\nAnthropic Messages API requests can replay assistant thinking blocks into the next turn. Templates that read `message.reasoning_content` currently receive an empty reasoning channel because the adapter wraps that history into assistant content instead.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Pass prior thinking as `reasoning_content` when the tokenizer chat template references that field.\n- Keep custom chat encoders on the native path and preserve marker wrapping for templates that do not reference `reasoning_content`.\n\nFixes #40959\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n```text\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q test/registered/unit/entrypoints/anthropic/test_serving.py\n63 passed, 4 warnings, 5 subtests passed\n\n.venv/bin/pre-commit run --files python/sglang/srt/entrypoints/anthropic/serving.py test/registered/unit/entrypoints/anthropic/test_serving.py\nAll selected hooks passed\n```\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable. This request-history conversion does not affect inference speed or scheduling.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/docs/developer_guide/contribution_guide.md#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/docs/developer_guide/contribution_guide.md#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/docs/developer_guide/contribution_guide.md#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #36059853651](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36059853651)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #36059853227](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36059853227)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #36059853371](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36059853371)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
